    "visible_sequence": [
      "lo0 = low; atr0 = hi0-lo0. The hi0 definition immediately above the viewport is not visible.",
      "sum1 = sum(hi0-lo0, days1)/days1. If all ranges in the window are positive, atr1 := sum1 and date1 := time.",
      "cdn1 compares atr0 to atr1*chg1 and atr1*chg2, or is true when filtering is disabled.",
      "Arrays of length days1 are initialized with current values.",
      "Only if cdn1[1] is true: loop i1=1..days1; use passing historical offset i1; on failure loop i2=i1 down to 1 until a passing more recent offset is found, copying it into this slot.",
      "That block sets date1 := time[1] and atr1 := array.avg(arr3). Multiple slots can contain the same accepted historical bar.",
      "If cdn1[1] is false, the replacement block does not run. Earlier raw-mean assignment remains when its positive-range condition was met.",
      "sl = rounded(atr1 * input(0.2, step=0.05)); ch = rounded(abs(close-close[1])/atr1*100)."
    ],
